  "description": "An advanced keyset-based pagination package that uses a fluent-style builder to create queries that cater for forward and backward navigation for any given deterministic base query. Each page of results includes a 'continuation token' for the current, next, and previous page. These tokens can be used at a later time to navigate to the same location within the dataset, thereby somewhat overcoming the inability of random access traditionally associated with keyset-based navigation.",
